  "keyFeatures": [
    "Task grid with configurable columns, tree hierarchy, and inline cell editing",
    "Projects / summary tasks and milestones with type-aware rendering",
    "Zoomable single or dual time scale with configurable unit (minute to year)",
    "Four dependency link types (FS, SS, FF, SF) with lag and drag-to-create",
    "Drag-and-drop scheduling — move and resize task bars",
    "Progress indicators editable via lightbox or inline",
    "Lightbox task editor with configurable sections and custom controls",
    "Smart rendering for large datasets (only visible rows/columns drawn)",
    "Multiple independent chart instances via Gantt factory",
    "Template system to override any rendered element",
    "Plugins: tooltips, quick info, fullscreen, keyboard navigation, drag-timeline, click-drag",
    "Data loading/saving via JSON/XML parsing and REST dataProcessor",
    "Export to PDF, PNG, Excel, iCal, and MS Project via DHTMLX export service",
    "Skins: Material, Terrace, Meadow, Broadway, Skyblue, Dark, and more",
    "32 locales, WAI-ARIA accessibility, touch support, CSP-compliant mode",
    "100+ event system covering interactions and lifecycle hooks",
    "Full TypeScript definitions bundled",
    "Framework integrations: React, Angular, Vue, Svelte"
  ],
  "publicApiSurface": [
